+## Coupled-status ownership
+
+The native `coupled-status` command owns no new persistent state. It reads the
+existing coupled-run manifest at `iterations.json` and durable per-iteration
+ledgers at `iteration-NN/state/tui-work.json`; `src/work_budget.rs` and the
+coupled-run persistence remain the owners of those records. The status command
+only validates and projects recorded request counts, pending usage, and native
+completion state. Unknown interrupted usage is represented as `null`, and the
+projection is not independent verification or promotion authorization.
